Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c32b2f5c51027c42188c7cb1836b6ad6","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]LolaTX[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Those colors look amazing together![\/quote] \n We picked pink and orange for our colors too!  I love it because it such a fun color palette","Attachments":[],"Id":1641942,"PostDate":1342453935,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>LolaTX<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Those colors look amazing together!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> We picked pink and orange for our colors too!\u00a0 I love it because it such a fun color palette<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"carolyn.webre@selu.edu","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1295355593,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235700.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Mufin1785","Id":235700,"Name":"Mufin1785","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"afadadd76d1ff19864782e6e7a72816c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I knew I wanted a pink\/orange colour to start with and fell in love with David&#039;s Bridal&#039;s guava which is coral. I basically picked the version of pink\/coral I wanted based on the colours available in the BM dress I liked :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Our colours are coral\/guava with bright turquoise.....maybe going to add in some yellow and going for bright tropical flowers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I absolutely love the pink\/orange against turqoise water!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1642106,"PostDate":1342490871,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I knew I wanted a pink\/orange colour to start with and fell in love with David's Bridal's guava which is coral. I basically picked the version of pink\/coral I wanted based on the colours available in the BM dress I liked <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Our colours are coral\/guava with bright turquoise.....maybe going to add in some yellow and going for bright tropical flowers.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I absolutely love the pink\/orange against turqoise water!!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bethvolpov@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1313025644,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243668.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Vancouver Bride","Id":243668,"Name":"Vancouver Bride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fd89f71b01f03a911f556416852edeef","RawContent":"I love both those colour combos but especially the blue and yellow as those are my colours! We are doing a lighter blue, though. What kinds of flowers are on the cake and in the bouquet for the yellow\/blue combo? Love it!! I&#039;d like a simply decorated cake as well...let the flowers\/colours speak for themselves! \n \n Thanks! \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AMW Studios[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Ladies!!  \n \n From a photographers standpoint, we absolutely love vibrant colors, it&#039;s always so much fun to see what our brides are coming up with for color combo&#039;s. Last year I swear we had three weddings in a row that were navy blue and pink!  For the beach I think that navy blue with pink would look great but I would definitely consider adding some yellows or oranges to make your colors really pop against the sand\/ocean.  \n \n One of our brides recently had navy accents but all of her flowers were orange and pink. I thought it was stunning (her wedding was on a farm but I think the colors would work equally well for a beach)! \n \n\n[center]            [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/890236\/width\/600\/height\/585[\/img][\/center] \n \n Another one of our brides who got married in mexico chose yellow and blue \n \n\n[center]            [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/890240\/width\/600\/height\/545[\/img][\/center] \n \n We just recently shot a wedding where the bride had chosen yellow and grey, pictures are still being edited but I have to say this is one of my new favorite color combo&#039;s.  \n \n Pinterest is such a great (addictive, be prepared to give up hours of your life) resource when comes to details\/colors etc...[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1643285,"PostDate":1342711968,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I love both those colour combos but especially the blue and yellow as those are my colours! We are doing a lighter blue, though. What kinds of flowers are on the cake and in the bouquet for the yellow\/blue combo? Love it!! I'd like a simply decorated cake as well...let the flowers\/colours speak for themselves!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AMW Studios<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Ladies!!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> From a photographers standpoint, we absolutely love vibrant colors, it's always so much fun to see what our brides are coming up with for color combo's. Last year I swear we had three weddings in a row that were navy blue and pink!\u00a0\u00a0For the beach I think that navy blue with pink would look great but I would definitely consider adding some yellows or oranges to make your colors really pop against the sand\/ocean.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> One of our brides recently had navy accents but all of her flowers were orange and pink. I thought it was stunning (her wedding was on a farm but I think the colors would work equally well for a beach)!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Pink-orange-navy.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/890236\/width\/600\/height\/585\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Another one of our brides who got married in mexico chose yellow and blue<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Yellow-blue.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/890240\/width\/600\/height\/545\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We just recently shot a wedding where the bride had chosen yellow and grey, pictures are still being edited but I have to say this is one of my new favorite color combo's.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Pinterest is such a great (addictive, be prepared to give up hours of your life) resource when comes to details\/colors etc...\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>~ December 5, 2012 ~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><span>~ Las Caletas, Mexico ~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"anyanatasha@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1311177242,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-242570.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Branya2012","Id":242570,"Name":"Branya2012","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"624d6f9528411105afb4a5f7769d2ff3","RawContent":"Really love the pops of jewelry! This is giving me major inspiration for yellow accessories - such a delish color choice! \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AMW Studios[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Ladies!!  \n \n From a photographers standpoint, we absolutely love vibrant colors, it&#039;s always so much fun to see what our brides are coming up with for color combo&#039;s. Last year I swear we had three weddings in a row that were navy blue and pink!  For the beach I think that navy blue with pink would look great but I would definitely consider adding some yellows or oranges to make your colors really pop against the sand\/ocean.  \n \n One of our brides recently had navy accents but all of her flowers were orange and pink. I thought it was stunning (her wedding was on a farm but I think the colors would work equally well for a beach)! \n \n\n[center]            [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/890236\/width\/600\/height\/585[\/img][\/center] \n \n Another one of our brides who got married in mexico chose yellow and blue \n \n\n[center]            [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/890240\/width\/600\/height\/545[\/img][\/center] \n \n We just recently shot a wedding where the bride had chosen yellow and grey, pictures are still being edited but I have to say this is one of my new favorite color combo&#039;s.  \n \n Pinterest is such a great (addictive, be prepared to give up hours of your life) resource when comes to details\/colors etc...[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1643628,"PostDate":1342791927,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Really love the pops of jewelry! This is giving me major inspiration for yellow accessories - such a delish color choice!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AMW Studios<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Ladies!!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> From a photographers standpoint, we absolutely love vibrant colors, it's always so much fun to see what our brides are coming up with for color combo's. Last year I swear we had three weddings in a row that were navy blue and pink!\u00a0\u00a0For the beach I think that navy blue with pink would look great but I would definitely consider adding some yellows or oranges to make your colors really pop against the sand\/ocean.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> One of our brides recently had navy accents but all of her flowers were orange and pink. I thought it was stunning (her wedding was on a farm but I think the colors would work equally well for a beach)!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Pink-orange-navy.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/890236\/width\/600\/height\/585\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Another one of our brides who got married in mexico chose yellow and blue<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Yellow-blue.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/890240\/width\/600\/height\/545\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"text-align: center\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We just recently shot a wedding where the bride had chosen yellow and grey, pictures are still being edited but I have to say this is one of my new favorite color combo's.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Pinterest is such a great (addictive, be prepared to give up hours of your life) resource when comes to details\/colors etc...\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"redibychelsea@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1245201937,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218520.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bondgirl0072010","Id":218520,"Name":"bondgirl0072010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"085bbb929d803af50ab16d26f0177b7a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I used Turquoise &amp;amp; Ivory..... it was so simple but so beautiful!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img data-id=\"152926\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/152926\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img data-id=\"152927\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/152927\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1643715,"PostDate":1342808912,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I used Turquoise & Ivory..... it was so simple but so beautiful!<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"152926\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/152926\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"152927\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/152927\/width\/200\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nfldsheehan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1327328443,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250386.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"heatherjimic","Id":250386,"Name":"heatherjimic","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cc04f7f2b0a9976a54b6ef81a54c52fd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I LOVE navy and pink: my 2 fav colors but for a beach wedding I have actually gone with navy, aqua, and coral. Its still (kinda) my fav colors with a twist that fits in with the beach setting. I say do blue and pink and just incorporate things found in the ocean or on the beach so that pink wont be a random color you choose esp if you choose hot pink. I believe having beach weddings are the simplest because you can use nature for lots of things! Good luck! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1644501,"PostDate":1343076220,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I LOVE navy and pink: my 2 fav colors but for a beach wedding I have actually gone with navy, aqua, and coral. Its still (kinda) my fav colors with a twist that fits in with the beach setting. I say do blue and pink and just incorporate things found in the ocean or on the beach so that pink wont be a random color you choose esp if you choose hot pink. I believe having beach weddings are the simplest because you can use nature for lots of things! Good luck! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleyntuttle88@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1343043033,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258216.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"beachbride14","Id":258216,"Name":"beachbride14","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8c1001319d2007488612cab0459e19de","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I LOVE navy and pink: my 2 fav colors but for a beach wedding I have actually gone with navy, aqua, and coral. Its still (kinda) my fav colors with a twist that fits in with the beach setting. I say do blue and pink and just incorporate things found in the ocean or on the beach so that pink wont be a random color you choose esp if you choose hot pink. I believe having beach weddings are the simplest because you can use nature for lots of things! Good luck! :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1644502,"PostDate":1343076529,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I LOVE navy and pink: my 2 fav colors but for a beach wedding I have actually gone with navy, aqua, and coral. Its still (kinda) my fav colors with a twist that fits in with the beach setting. I say do blue and pink and just incorporate things found in the ocean or on the beach so that pink wont be a random color you choose esp if you choose hot pink. I believe having beach weddings are the simplest because you can use nature for lots of things! Good luck! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleyntuttle88@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1343043033,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258216.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"beachbride14","Id":258216,"Name":"beachbride14","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6fe3495b94bc652e6c2fedaeb4ee30f6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size:22px;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;I LOVE navy and pink: my 2 fav colors but for a beach wedding I have actually gone with navy, aqua, and coral. Its still (kinda) my fav colors with a twist that fits in with the beach setting. I say do blue and pink and just incorporate things found in the ocean or on the beach so that pink wont be a random color you choose esp if you choose hot pink. I believe having beach weddings are the simplest because you can use nature for lots of things! Good luck! :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1644504,"PostDate":1343076617,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size:22px\"><strong>I LOVE navy and pink: my 2 fav colors but for a beach wedding I have actually gone with navy, aqua, and coral. Its still (kinda) my fav colors with a twist that fits in with the beach setting. I say do blue and pink and just incorporate things found in the ocean or on the beach so that pink wont be a random color you choose esp if you choose hot pink. I believe having beach weddings are the simplest because you can use nature for lots of things! Good luck! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleyntuttle88@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1343043033,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258216.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"beachbride14","Id":258216,"Name":"beachbride14","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b799c5bab2faa5d8808d53061c3b04f4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am torn between lime and purple or teal and white...&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1644843,"PostDate":1343140993,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am torn between lime and purple or teal and white...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"beaudoin.laura@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1343045387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258219.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"quackdoc","Id":258219,"Name":"quackdoc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e83c18a77a8eea25a3d9cc073a6bac1c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; i really want to do aqua and that bright red-orangey color that&#039;s so popular right now. but i don&#039;t think it&#039;ll be very easy to find sheers\/lanterns\/etc in that color... :\/&amp;nbsp; am probably going to go with hot pink and bright orange?\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1644932,"PostDate":1343152950,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> i really want to do aqua and that bright red-orangey color that's so popular right now. but i don't think it'll be very easy to find sheers\/lanterns\/etc in that color... :\/\u00a0 am probably going to go with hot pink and bright orange?<br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"karycrassweller@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1338227180,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255937.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"karyc","Id":255937,"Name":"karyc","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":378,"TotalPages":38,"CurrentPage":40,"NextPage":50,"PreviousPage":30,"LastPage":370},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
