{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"505a21b6e43273d43e98bd24d05c8dee","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow all these colours are beautiful! Almost make me re think our colours!!...I need some input the bridesmaid dresses are going to be a light lilac with white flowers and my fiance will be wearing white tux top with black pants... now we do not want the groomsmen in white but we think lilac on the guys may be too much purple...what do you think of light gray shirt for the guys with black pants? open to suggestions :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1648346,"PostDate":1343901125,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow all these colours are beautiful! Almost make me re think our colours!!...I need some input the bridesmaid dresses are going to be a light lilac with white flowers and my fiance will be wearing white tux top with black pants... now we do not want the groomsmen in white but we think lilac on the guys may be too much purple...what do you think of light gray shirt for the guys with black pants? open to suggestions <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a.banville@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1341264859,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257390.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Amers","Id":257390,"Name":"Amers","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6731208dca8c09b0ef8987207b989125","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Amers[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Wow all these colours are beautiful! Almost make me re think our colours!!...I need some input the bridesmaid dresses are going to be a light lilac with white flowers and my fiance will be wearing white tux top with black pants... now we do not want the groomsmen in white but we think lilac on the guys may be too much purple...what do you think of light gray shirt for the guys with black pants? open to suggestions :)[\/quote] \n \n If you&#039;re not going to put the guys in white shirts, you may not have a lot of options.  Light gray will probably be your best bet to incorporate your colors.  We&#039;re doing coral and dark gray, with the girls in coral dresses (knee-length) and the guys are in white shirts and dark gray pants.  I want to match the boutonnieres for the groomsmen with the dresses for the bridesmaids and have my FI&#039;s boutonniere match part of my bouquet.   I like the lilac and gray together, though. :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1648410,"PostDate":1343909396,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Amers<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Wow all these colours are beautiful! Almost make me re think our colours!!...I need some input the bridesmaid dresses are going to be a light lilac with white flowers and my fiance will be wearing white tux top with black pants... now we do not want the groomsmen in white but we think lilac on the guys may be too much purple...what do you think of light gray shirt for the guys with black pants? open to suggestions <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> If you're not going to put the guys in white shirts, you may not have a lot of options. \u00a0Light gray will probably be your best bet to incorporate your colors. \u00a0We're doing coral and dark gray, with the girls in coral dresses (knee-length) and the guys are in white shirts and dark gray pants. \u00a0I want to match the boutonnieres for the groomsmen with the dresses for the bridesmaids and have my FI's boutonniere match part of my bouquet. \u00a0 I like the lilac and gray together, though. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bmelko@ymail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1337785216,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255751.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":173,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bmelko","Id":255751,"Name":"bmelko","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7fb7148fe2562414600c4b794d82c478","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]bmelko[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n If you&#039;re not going to put the guys in white shirts, you may not have a lot of options.  Light gray will probably be your best bet to incorporate your colors.  We&#039;re doing coral and dark gray, with the girls in coral dresses (knee-length) and the guys are in white shirts and dark gray pants.  I want to match the boutonnieres for the groomsmen with the dresses for the bridesmaids and have my FI&#039;s boutonniere match part of my bouquet.   I like the lilac and gray together, though. :)[\/quote] \n  Your right thank you for your input i think I will stick with the white\/light gray...maybe i will even do light gray shirts with white ties! I love your choice of colour as well!! its so difficult to pick when you see everyone ideas there all so pretty and unique :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1648483,"PostDate":1343914565,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>bmelko<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> If you're not going to put the guys in white shirts, you may not have a lot of options. \u00a0Light gray will probably be your best bet to incorporate your colors. \u00a0We're doing coral and dark gray, with the girls in coral dresses (knee-length) and the guys are in white shirts and dark gray pants. \u00a0I want to match the boutonnieres for the groomsmen with the dresses for the bridesmaids and have my FI's boutonniere match part of my bouquet. \u00a0 I like the lilac and gray together, though. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0Your right thank you for your input i think I will stick with the white\/light gray...maybe i will even do light gray shirts with white ties! I love your choice of colour as well!! its so difficult to pick when you see everyone ideas there all so pretty and unique <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a.banville@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1341264859,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257390.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Amers","Id":257390,"Name":"Amers","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bb6bb237d64925d6143ce15f05a64f60","RawContent":"&lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1343933462771_1190\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;What colors did you end up going with?... My colors were inspired by the flowers I am DIYing.. Orange and Pink. :o)   For my passport invites I had to incorporate a 3rd color, so I chose a light lime green. Maybe you could change out the green for a blue. :o)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img data-id=\"155333\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/155333\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1648495,"PostDate":1343915622,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1343933462771_1190\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0What colors did you end up going with?... My colors were inspired by the flowers I am DIYing.. Orange and Pink. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>)\u00a0\u00a0 For my passport invites I had to incorporate a 3rd color, so I chose a light lime green. Maybe you could change out the green for a blue. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>)<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"155333\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/155333\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"britneyrasco@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1329412672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251499.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissBubbles205","Id":251499,"Name":"MissBubbles205","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8fc362c42b5c7691fd586903887a95aa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am kind of all over the place with colors. I waffle between wanting fun, bright, summery colors like lemon yellow and lime green and turquoise, and more muted tones like purples, creams and greys because that&#039;s more me. I feel like I should go bright since it&#039;ll be springtime, on the beach and in Jamaica, but I keep finding myself drawn to purple things. Like this bouquet (it&#039;s actually paper!!) that I saw in an Etsy shop.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1343933660086_1494\"&gt; &lt;img data-id=\"155334\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/155334\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1648504,"PostDate":1343916367,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am kind of all over the place with colors. I waffle between wanting fun, bright, summery colors like lemon yellow and lime green and turquoise, and more muted tones like purples, creams and greys because that's more me. I feel like I should go bright since it'll be springtime, on the beach and in Jamaica, but I keep finding myself drawn to purple things. Like this bouquet (it's actually paper!!) that I saw in an Etsy shop.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1343933660086_1494\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"155334\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/155334\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alexismmoore@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.231.22.147","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1337115561,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255437.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":667,"PhotoHeight":1000,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"alexisinjamaica","Id":255437,"Name":"alexisinjamaica","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7d08e04469c129dd285ce996f60107c3","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]alexisinjamaica[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I am kind of all over the place with colors. I waffle between wanting fun, bright, summery colors like lemon yellow and lime green and turquoise, and more muted tones like purples, creams and greys because that&#039;s more me. I feel like I should go bright since it&#039;ll be springtime, on the beach and in Jamaica, but I keep finding myself drawn to purple things. Like this bouquet (it&#039;s actually paper!!) that I saw in an Etsy shop. \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/155334\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img][\/quote] \n  OMG.. I LOVE that bouquet!! Paper? How awesome!!.. \n \n hehe.. I&#039;m beginning to think we are more alike than I thought.. My first choice of colors looked just like this bouquet minus the dark purple.. This color theme screams Jamaican though!!.. \n \n I ended up also going with pink and orange since we were doing a destination... no wedding other than a DW can get away with such crazy colors. :o)","Attachments":[],"Id":1648508,"PostDate":1343916616,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>alexisinjamaica<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I am kind of all over the place with colors. I waffle between wanting fun, bright, summery colors like lemon yellow and lime green and turquoise, and more muted tones like purples, creams and greys because that's more me. I feel like I should go bright since it'll be springtime, on the beach and in Jamaica, but I keep finding myself drawn to purple things. Like this bouquet (it's actually paper!!) that I saw in an Etsy shop.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1343933660086_1494\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"155334\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/155334\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0OMG.. I LOVE that bouquet!! Paper? How awesome!!..<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> hehe.. I'm beginning to think we are more alike than I thought.. My first choice of colors looked just like this bouquet minus the dark purple.. This color theme screams Jamaican though!!..<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I ended up also going with pink and orange since we were doing a destination... no wedding other than a DW can get away with such crazy colors. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"britneyrasco@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1329412672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251499.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissBubbles205","Id":251499,"Name":"MissBubbles205","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"65bdf619c73230831327ac8b8bd77d09","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]MissBubbles205[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n  OMG.. I LOVE that bouquet!! Paper? How awesome!!.. \n \n hehe.. I&#039;m beginning to think we are more alike than I thought.. My first choice of colors looked just like this bouquet minus the dark purple.. This color theme screams Jamaican though!!.. \n \n I ended up also going with pink and orange since we were doing a destination... no wedding other than a DW can get away with such crazy colors. :o)[\/quote] \n \n Yep, paper!! Here&#039;s the designer&#039;s website: [url=\"http:\/\/www.loveleeflowers.com\/wedding.html\"]http:\/\/www.loveleeflowers.com\/wedding.html[\/url] \n \n You are right about the pink and orange being perfect for a DW. I love that combo too! See? All over the place!","Attachments":[],"Id":1648515,"PostDate":1343916959,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>MissBubbles205<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0OMG.. I LOVE that bouquet!! Paper? How awesome!!..<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> hehe.. I'm beginning to think we are more alike than I thought.. My first choice of colors looked just like this bouquet minus the dark purple.. This color theme screams Jamaican though!!..<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I ended up also going with pink and orange since we were doing a destination... no wedding other than a DW can get away with such crazy colors. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>)<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Yep, paper!! Here's the designer's website: <a href='http:\/\/www.loveleeflowers.com\/wedding.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.loveleefl...om\/wedding.html<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> You are right about the pink and orange being perfect for a DW. I love that combo too! See? All over the place!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alexismmoore@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.231.22.147","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1337115561,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255437.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":667,"PhotoHeight":1000,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"alexisinjamaica","Id":255437,"Name":"alexisinjamaica","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"37cdc8587d84f47285cfa9c2a3895800","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]tyrebride2b2013[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Oh okay my girls and I have seen some dresses that they really like that were Alfred Angelo, I think I am going to with them.[\/quote] \n Awww great to hear!!!! What colors are you going with? Are you girls wearing short or long? Did you find a lot of choices for destination weddings? I found a few that i like on their website, now just need to see how they look on the girls","Attachments":[],"Id":1648558,"PostDate":1343920553,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>tyrebride2b2013<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Oh okay my girls and I have seen some dresses that they really like that were Alfred Angelo, I think I am going to with them. \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Awww great to hear!!!! What colors are you going with? Are you girls wearing short or long? Did you find a lot of choices for destination weddings? I found a few that i like on their website, now just need to see how they look on the girls<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\"ever thine ever mine ever ours\"<\/span><span>~ Ludwig von Beethoven, and more famously by Mr. Big!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><em>Now Larimar 8\/9\/13; I married my best friend! 29 of my closest friends and family celebrated with us! Couldn't have wished for anything better <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/em><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jam080913@gmail.com","IpAddress":"65.78.110.90","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1341004105,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257293.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifer8913","Id":257293,"Name":"jennifer8913","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e447577d1be725c0f8dafa470f49a901","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]MissBubbles205[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n  OMG.. I LOVE that bouquet!! Paper? How awesome!!.. \n \n hehe.. I&#039;m beginning to think we are more alike than I thought.. My first choice of colors looked just like this bouquet minus the dark purple.. This color theme screams Jamaican though!!.. \n \n I ended up also going with pink and orange since we were doing a destination... no wedding other than a DW can get away with such crazy colors. :o)[\/quote] \n \n I&#039;ve seen some really nice photos of purple weddings for destination wedding.  I think it&#039;s pretty and the cool colours are nice with the ocean!  There are so many different tones of purple.  You could go with a mauve or something on the more neutral side, rather than bright purple.  Look how pretty this is :) .... \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/155429\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img]","Attachments":[],"Id":1648652,"PostDate":1343935162,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>MissBubbles205<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0OMG.. I LOVE that bouquet!! Paper? How awesome!!..<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> hehe.. I'm beginning to think we are more alike than I thought.. My first choice of colors looked just like this bouquet minus the dark purple.. This color theme screams Jamaican though!!..<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I ended up also going with pink and orange since we were doing a destination... no wedding other than a DW can get away with such crazy colors. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/ohmy.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':o' \/>)<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I've seen some really nice photos of purple weddings for destination wedding. \u00a0I think it's pretty and the cool colours are nice with the ocean! \u00a0There are so many different tones of purple. \u00a0You could go with a mauve or something on the more neutral side, rather than bright purple. \u00a0Look how pretty this is <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> ....<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"155429\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/155429\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px\"> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bridemichelle@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1335696812,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254695.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"PuntaBride","Id":254695,"Name":"PuntaBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a2db1659c9f5d717df95b0c07fd85f81","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]PuntaBride[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n I&#039;ve seen some really nice photos of purple weddings for destination wedding.  I think it&#039;s pretty and the cool colours are nice with the ocean!  There are so many different tones of purple.  You could go with a mauve or something on the more neutral side, rather than bright purple.  Look how pretty this is :) .... \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/155429\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n \n[\/quote] \n \n Oooh I love! Thanks for sharing!","Attachments":[],"Id":1648656,"PostDate":1343935570,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>PuntaBride<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I've seen some really nice photos of purple weddings for destination wedding. \u00a0I think it's pretty and the cool colours are nice with the ocean! \u00a0There are so many different tones of purple. \u00a0You could go with a mauve or something on the more neutral side, rather than bright purple. \u00a0Look how pretty this is <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> ....<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"155429\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/155429\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"margin: 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px 0.0px\"> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Oooh I love! Thanks for sharing!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"alexismmoore@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.231.22.147","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1337115561,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255437.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":667,"PhotoHeight":1000,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"alexisinjamaica","Id":255437,"Name":"alexisinjamaica","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":378,"TotalPages":38,"CurrentPage":60,"NextPage":70,"PreviousPage":50,"LastPage":370},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
