{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"97883c66f2c361e5bed77f51df2153eb","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Shay4966[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I think the lime green and pink is HOT!! and completely different. Because they are both bold colors and pop you need to make one an accent color and one a main color with base color like yellow or orange. You can even do aqua or black as a base color.  \n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/155912\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/155913\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/155914\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img] \n \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/155915\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img][\/quote] \n so pretty and tropical looking!!!! i am doing fuchsia and tangerine with sand and white, love the POP!!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1649928,"PostDate":1344339637,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Shay4966<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I think the lime green and pink is HOT!! and completely different. Because they are both bold colors and pop you need to make one an accent color and one a main color with base color like yellow or orange. You can even do aqua or black as a base color.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1344353834674_1583\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"155912\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/155912\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1344353834674_2288\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"155913\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/155913\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1344353834674_3005\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"155914\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/155914\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1344353834674_3776\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' data-id=\"155915\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/155915\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> so pretty and tropical looking!!!! i am doing fuchsia and tangerine with sand and white, love the POP!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\">\"ever thine ever mine ever ours\"<\/span><span>~ Ludwig von Beethoven, and more famously by Mr. Big!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><em>Now Larimar 8\/9\/13; I married my best friend! 29 of my closest friends and family celebrated with us! Couldn't have wished for anything better <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/em><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jam080913@gmail.com","IpAddress":"65.78.110.90","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1341004105,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257293.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jennifer8913","Id":257293,"Name":"jennifer8913","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b50642f9dcf9fb6a260620a41648437","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jennifer8913[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n so pretty and tropical looking!!!! i am doing fuchsia and tangerine with sand and white, love the POP!!![\/quote] \n Very nice colors, these colors will definitely POP!! I have seen some very nice things with these two colors (maybe different variations of orange) You should have not problem getting inspiration on this board cause a lot of brides love this color combo..","Attachments":[],"Id":1649951,"PostDate":1344342246,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jennifer8913<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> so pretty and tropical looking!!!! i am doing fuchsia and tangerine with sand and white, love the POP!!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Very nice colors, these colors will definitely POP!! I have seen some very nice things with these two colors (maybe different variations of orange) You should have not problem getting inspiration on this board cause a lot of brides love this color combo..\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><\/div><\/div>","Email":"sha4966@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1312894978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243584.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Shay4966","Id":243584,"Name":"Shay4966","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"483add6d1ba37bda632dace04767862e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; i agree that Navy and pink would go well together!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1650685,"PostDate":1344508092,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> i agree that Navy and pink would go well together!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lorelle.curry@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1344437141,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258948.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cheflady","Id":258948,"Name":"cheflady","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"99d04a09a1663952d81c246c68c1d9ce","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I love navy and pink together!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1650734,"PostDate":1344512986,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I love navy and pink together!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lorelle.curry@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1344437141,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258948.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cheflady","Id":258948,"Name":"cheflady","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cc7194bbdf0adcb8f91cff79f9f5d08f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; my colors are whit and black with accent colors being red, orange , yellow, green blue and purple&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; i love it but everyone i talk to says that it is a. no beachy and b to colorful&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; but i got the idea off of those bright beach towels&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1651409,"PostDate":1344679934,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> my colors are whit and black with accent colors being red, orange , yellow, green blue and purple<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> i love it but everyone i talk to says that it is a. no beachy and b to colorful<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> but i got the idea off of those bright beach towels<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"wallaby_meisje@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1344615654,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-259034.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"wallabymeisje","Id":259034,"Name":"wallabymeisje","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6691fa19732cd7b105119e0898356ebd","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt; Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;  Quote:Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;wallabymeisje&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; my colors are whit and black with accent colors being red, orange , yellow, green blue and purple&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; i love it but everyone i talk to says that it is a. no beachy and b to colorful&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; but i got the idea off of those bright beach towels&lt;\/p&gt;  &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; That is a lot of colors. It may be hard to incorporate all of them evenly into your wedding. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;ve heard that the rule is to keep them to three to four at the most to keep the color from being all over the place. &amp;nbsp;Ultimately, though, it&#039;s your wedding, so make sure you do what you want. :) &amp;nbsp;Don&#039;t let anyone talk you into doing\/having something you don&#039;t want or into not doing\/having something you do want.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1651717,"PostDate":1344772416,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\"> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">  Quote:Originally Posted by <strong>wallabymeisje<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> my colors are whit and black with accent colors being red, orange , yellow, green blue and purple<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> i love it but everyone i talk to says that it is a. no beachy and b to colorful<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> but i got the idea off of those bright beach towels<\/p>  <\/div> <\/div> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> That is a lot of colors. It may be hard to incorporate all of them evenly into your wedding. \u00a0I've heard that the rule is to keep them to three to four at the most to keep the color from being all over the place. \u00a0Ultimately, though, it's your wedding, so make sure you do what you want. <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0Don't let anyone talk you into doing\/having something you don't want or into not doing\/having something you do want.<\/p> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bmelko@ymail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1337785216,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255751.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":173,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bmelko","Id":255751,"Name":"bmelko","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d65dd62b3cb832377f3f9111ddb1f9c","RawContent":"Do you know where the bride got those maracas or how I could get in contact with the bride?","Attachments":[],"Id":1652502,"PostDate":1344940747,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Do you know where the bride got those maracas or how I could get in contact with the bride?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Shelleyfarrell28@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1325769936,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249392.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Shelley123","Id":249392,"Name":"Shelley123","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53a892bd512c937eed3de9016e2b435f","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Shelley123[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Do you know where the bride got those maracas or how I could get in contact with the bride?[\/quote] \n I&#039;m not sure which post you are replying to but this website [url=\"http:\/\/www.amols.com\/catalog\/medium-traditional-maracas\"]http:\/\/www.amols.com\/catalog\/medium-traditional-maracas[\/url] has great priced maracas.","Attachments":[],"Id":1652507,"PostDate":1344941922,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Shelley123<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Do you know where the bride got those maracas or how I could get in contact with the bride?<\/blockquote> <p> I'm not sure which post you are replying to but this website\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.amols.com\/catalog\/medium-traditional-maracas' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.amols.com...itional-maracas<\/a>\u00a0has great priced maracas.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>62 guest booked, plus Bride and Groom!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"shannon1@carolina.rr.com","IpAddress":"24.142.196.138","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1277908618,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229743.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shannonmarie","Id":229743,"Name":"shannonmarie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a3a2cf582966b0044db031660277904","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Everyone&#039;s doing such bright colours! I feel like mine are dark in comparison.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Our colours are teal with brown, beige, white and green. Keeping it fairly neutral, but I&#039;m hoping the teal will pop against the sand.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1345169105507_1883\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"158088\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158088\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1653633,"PostDate":1345151663,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Everyone's doing such bright colours! I feel like mine are dark in comparison.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Our colours are teal with brown, beige, white and green. Keeping it fairly neutral, but I'm hoping the teal will pop against the sand.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1345169105507_1883\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"158088\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158088\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kschnella@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1328770673,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251197.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cinnagirl","Id":251197,"Name":"cinnagirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"653263d714732f98950d02c0843c2702","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]cinnagirl[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Everyone&#039;s doing such bright colours! I feel like mine are dark in comparison.  \n \n Our colours are teal with brown, beige, white and green. Keeping it fairly neutral, but I&#039;m hoping the teal will pop against the sand.  \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158088\/width\/350\/height\/700[\/img][\/quote] \n I think it&#039;s going to look amazing.  The  teal is a good contrast against the sand.  I don&#039;t feel like they&#039;re too dark; in fact, I love the neutral colors together, the blend really well.","Attachments":[],"Id":1653698,"PostDate":1345190265,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>cinnagirl<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Everyone's doing such bright colours! I feel like mine are dark in comparison.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Our colours are teal with brown, beige, white and green. Keeping it fairly neutral, but I'm hoping the teal will pop against the sand.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1345169105507_1883\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"158088\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158088\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I think it's going to look amazing. \u00a0The \u00a0teal is a good contrast against the sand. \u00a0I don't feel like they're too dark; in fact, I love the neutral colors together, the blend really well.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"bmelko@ymail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1337785216,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255751.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":173,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bmelko","Id":255751,"Name":"bmelko","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":378,"TotalPages":38,"CurrentPage":80,"NextPage":90,"PreviousPage":70,"LastPage":370},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
