{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f23a6d1fe9114410ef09dcb3d342c2eb","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]jackie44[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n wel ive finally decided .. \n       my weding dress is ivory \n    bridesmaid dresses r champagne \n jusr ordered bridesmaid flowers which r ivory,baby pink and lilac with diamontes and pearls in .. \n \n very subtle ..what do you guys think ?[\/quote] \n Very classy!","Attachments":[],"Id":1656542,"PostDate":1345822482,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>jackie44<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> wel ive finally decided ..<\/p> <p> \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 my weding dress is ivory<\/p> <p> \u00a0 \u00a0bridesmaid dresses r champagne<\/p> <p> jusr ordered bridesmaid flowers which r ivory,baby pink and lilac with diamontes and pearls in ..<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> very subtle ..what do you guys think ?\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Very classy!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katryned@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1342529142,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-257981.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Katryne","Id":257981,"Name":"Katryne","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"33a977f9389af9bcd61c7495285d8b72","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]MissBubbles205[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I&#039;ve never been a fan of converse bc I look odd in them.. but I love how they incorporated the converses into the wedding!!.. Especially love the pic with their shoes in the chairs!!![\/quote] \n \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Katryne[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Very cool! Love the converses![\/quote] \n \n Thanks for your comments ladies!! \n \n We LOVE Converse, they are just soo different. \n \n Best wishes planning your day :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1657629,"PostDate":1346173272,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>MissBubbles205<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I've never been a fan of converse bc I look odd in them.. but I love how they incorporated the converses into the wedding!!.. Especially love the pic with their shoes in the chairs!!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Katryne<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Very cool! Love the converses!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks for your comments ladies!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We LOVE Converse, they are just soo different.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Best wishes planning your day <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@delsolphotography.com","IpAddress":"189.221.144.61","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1175001240,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207303.gif?_r=0","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Matt Adcock","Id":207303,"Name":"Matt Adcock","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53280c89f1b6b15adcbfcbb80220c954","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Matt Adcock[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hello Ladies, \n \n I&#039;ve seen all kinds of wedding colors, but when I think of this topic, the only wedding that comes to my mind, is one of my all-time favorites: &lt;strong&gt;[img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159053\/width\/900\/height\/600[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159054\/width\/900\/height\/600[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159055\/width\/900\/height\/600[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159056\/width\/900\/height\/600[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159057\/width\/900\/height\/600[\/img] \n \n Best wishes![\/quote] \n \n These pictures are absolutely amazing!!!! I LOVE LOVE converse and love how they did this!!! I wish I was having a larger wedding party!! I would totally steal this idea! I LOVE it! \n Thanks for sharing!!!! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1657800,"PostDate":1346226136,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Matt Adcock<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hello Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I've seen all kinds of wedding colors, but when I think of this topic, the only wedding that comes to my mind, is one of my all-time favorites: <strong><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"159053\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159053\/width\/900\/height\/600\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"159054\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159054\/width\/900\/height\/600\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"159055\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159055\/width\/900\/height\/600\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"159056\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159056\/width\/900\/height\/600\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"159057\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159057\/width\/900\/height\/600\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Best wishes!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> These pictures are absolutely amazing!!!! I LOVE LOVE converse and love how they did this!!! I wish I was having a larger wedding party!! I would totally steal this idea! I LOVE it!<\/p> <p> Thanks for sharing!!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span>62 guest booked, plus Bride and Groom!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"shannon1@carolina.rr.com","IpAddress":"24.142.196.138","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1277908618,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229743.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shannonmarie","Id":229743,"Name":"shannonmarie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5168a52985ce3f805fd3698779641e4a","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Matt Adcock\"]\nHello Ladies, I&#039;ve seen all kinds of wedding colors, but when I think of this topic, the only wedding that comes to my mind, is one of my all-time favorites: [b][url=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=474\"]Evan + Kari[\/url][\/b] at Secrets Maroma!! I just loved the pops of color and the Converse!!!! Hope you enjoy these few images: [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159053\/\"][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159053\/width\/900\/height\/600\/flags\/LL[\/img][\/url] [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159054\/\"][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159054\/width\/900\/height\/600\/flags\/LL[\/img][\/url] [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159055\/\"][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159055\/width\/900\/height\/600\/flags\/LL[\/img][\/url] [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159056\/\"][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159056\/width\/900\/height\/600\/flags\/LL[\/img][\/url] [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159057\/\"][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159057\/width\/900\/height\/600\/flags\/LL[\/img][\/url] Best wishes![\/quote] That is so cute! I love it!","Attachments":[],"Id":1658977,"PostDate":1346451923,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"Matt Adcock\" url=\"\/t\/79753\/wedding&#045;colors\/90#post_1805230\"><p>Hello Ladies, I've seen all kinds of wedding colors, but when I think of this topic, the only wedding that comes to my mind, is one of my all-time favorites: <strong class='bbc'><a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=474' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Evan + Kari<\/a><\/strong> at Secrets Maroma!! I just loved the pops of color and the Converse!!!! Hope you enjoy these few images: <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159053\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159053\/width\/900\/height\/600\/flags\/LL' alt='Posted Image'  \/><\/span><\/a> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159054\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159054\/width\/900\/height\/600\/flags\/LL' alt='Posted Image'  \/><\/span><\/a> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159055\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159055\/width\/900\/height\/600\/flags\/LL' alt='Posted Image'  \/><\/span><\/a> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159056\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159056\/width\/900\/height\/600\/flags\/LL' alt='Posted Image'  \/><\/span><\/a> <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159057\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/159057\/width\/900\/height\/600\/flags\/LL' alt='Posted Image'  \/><\/span><\/a> Best wishes!<\/p><\/blockquote> That is so cute! I love it!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span><span>What: Mexican beach wedding extravaganza<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span><span>When: January 18, 2013<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span><span>Where: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.realresorts.com\/The-Royal-Playa-Carmen\/\"><span>The Royal Playa Del Carmen<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span><span>Who: Soon-to-be Mr. & Mrs. Sprague; 50+ guests; <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/blog\"><span>del Sol Photography<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><span><span>Check out our wedding photos sneak peek from Del Sol: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/jordan-garrett-royal-playa-del-carmen-destination-wedding\/\">http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/jordan-garrett-royal-playa-del-carmen-destinatio...<\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"jordanblakesley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1337262132,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255499.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jordanb","Id":255499,"Name":"jordanb","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"75ab5d38c5e8be26a0166c4404b3c37a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I love these Save the Date....Can you tell me where you got them from?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1663092,"PostDate":1347609816,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I love these Save the Date....Can you tell me where you got them from?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nturn80@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1347609363,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260351.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Nturn80","Id":260351,"Name":"Nturn80","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2dbfceaec4ce180f35288759ab6ddd28","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp; i like &amp;nbsp;burgundy &amp;nbsp; and it&#039;s the theme color of the &amp;nbsp;wedding &amp;nbsp;, and my wedding dress is white which &amp;nbsp;i bought from kissdresses.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1663486,"PostDate":1347756003,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0 i like \u00a0burgundy \u00a0 and it's the theme color of the \u00a0wedding \u00a0, and my wedding dress is white which \u00a0i bought from kissdresses.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Emilyaspiration@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":5,"GroupName":"Banned","JoinDate":1347508818,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Emilythrone","Id":260319,"Name":"Emilythrone","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f2e55518a3d8cff5a8782d71f58b67d9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Teal is a great color&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1664901,"PostDate":1348098490,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Teal is a great color<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jpcalbone@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1347285672,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-260190.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"maryjonjet","Id":260190,"Name":"maryjonjet","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"82672a859180527998fa6c59c28ae427","RawContent":"@ jordanb and shannonmarie - I agree with you!  &amp;nbsp;  How to add fun to sophistication? The &lt;strong&gt;Evan and Kari&lt;\/strong&gt; wedding just achieved that! What an inspiration! Personally, I&#039;m fearless when it comes to playing with colors and the idea of using those striking hues amuses all of us! Well done!  &amp;nbsp;  Nowadays we could personalize our own weddings. Though we respect the traditional weddings of long ago, we now have several options of personalizing them, making every event symbolize who we really are. Cheers to adding fun and excitement to every wedding or celebration!&amp;nbsp;  &amp;nbsp;  Look at these stunning jewelry that indeed POP against any wedding or cocktail dress. Don&#039;t be afraid to experiment. Let&#039;s all have fun with colors!  &amp;nbsp;  &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"166791\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/166791\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;   &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"166793\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/166793\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;  &amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"166792\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/166792\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt;&amp;nbsp;   &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"166794\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/166794\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; \n  &lt;div&gt; XOXO  &amp;nbsp;  Chelsea &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1673857,"PostDate":1350069198,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                 @ jordanb and shannonmarie - I agree with you!  \u00a0  How to add fun to sophistication? The <strong>Evan and Kari<\/strong> wedding just achieved that! What an inspiration! Personally, I'm fearless when it comes to playing with colors and the idea of using those striking hues amuses all of us! Well done!  \u00a0  Nowadays we could personalize our own weddings. Though we respect the traditional weddings of long ago, we now have several options of personalizing them, making every event symbolize who we really are. Cheers to adding fun and excitement to every wedding or celebration!\u00a0  \u00a0  Look at these stunning jewelry that indeed POP against any wedding or cocktail dress. Don't be afraid to experiment. Let's all have fun with colors!  \u00a0  <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"166791\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/166791\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"166793\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/166793\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p>  \u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"166792\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/166792\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span>\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"166794\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/166794\/width\/350\/height\/700\" \/><\/span> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/>  <div> XOXO  \u00a0  Chelsea <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"redibychelsea@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1245201937,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-218520.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"bondgirl0072010","Id":218520,"Name":"bondgirl0072010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f5e8dd0793e2dd428cc13486c254dee6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; we have the same dilemma here. my daughter wants burlap and lace with light shades of pinks and blues and the men in grey suits. I am not sure if that goes together or not. btw she is getting married the same day you are!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1677357,"PostDate":1350918810,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> we have the same dilemma here. my daughter wants burlap and lace with light shades of pinks and blues and the men in grey suits. I am not sure if that goes together or not. btw she is getting married the same day you are!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"swharton36@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1350917978,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-261642.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shellshell","Id":261642,"Name":"shellshell","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":67485,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a23ab30a843d18c94f93d24df588db9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; where did you find these at?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1679579,"PostDate":1351362738,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> where did you find t