p> I just got back from Moon palace and thought I would put up a few pics of my tables <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kay_ell@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1320683251,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247453.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kristinalilly","Id":247453,"Name":"kristinalilly","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb18dd98965045fb074c87c07a058118","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; thanks for all the great ideas&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1601683,"PostDate":1333203852,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> thanks for all the great ideas<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"latteplease@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1332953696,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253324.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Josie Fiorda","Id":253324,"Name":"Josie Fiorda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5996238c9023f0aaafd0f54bf34b3edb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thank you for posting. I am trying to get some ideas on what to do for our wedding. Really like the shot glass idea.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1603489,"PostDate":1333528783,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you for posting. I am trying to get some ideas on what to do for our wedding. Really like the shot glass idea.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shellee2374@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1333231040,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253436.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Shelgal","Id":253436,"Name":"Shelgal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7f01d81b54131fba747657a1ad8e988a","RawContent":"this is too cute!  I haven&#039;t see that done before.  Hmmm... maybe this is how we&#039;ll do the kid&#039;s name tags for the reception!  probably asking for trouble that way, but might still give it a go!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]*Meagan*[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n here are a few from our Almost married reception. We did mini beach balls with everyones name and then their table number. You cant see them that great but you get the idea. Our photographer also got creative with my ring...\n \n [img]http:\/\/i18.photobucket.com\/albums\/b130\/MeagT11\/8834_578611486237_45603721_33922077.jpg[\/img]\n \n [img]http:\/\/i18.photobucket.com\/albums\/b130\/MeagT11\/8834_578611136937_45603721_33922014.jpg[\/img]\n \n [img]http:\/\/i18.photobucket.com\/albums\/b130\/MeagT11\/052.jpg[\/img][\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1605048,"PostDate":1333877814,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> this is too cute! \u00a0I haven't see that done before. \u00a0Hmmm... maybe this is how we'll do the kid's name tags for the reception! \u00a0probably asking for trouble that way, but might still give it a go!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>*Meagan*<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> here are a few from our Almost married reception. We did mini beach balls with everyones name and then their table number. You cant see them that great but you get the idea. Our photographer also got creative with my ring...<br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" border=\"0\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" src=\"http:\/\/i18.photobucket.com\/albums\/b130\/MeagT11\/8834_578611486237_45603721_33922077.jpg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" border=\"0\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" src=\"http:\/\/i18.photobucket.com\/albums\/b130\/MeagT11\/8834_578611136937_45603721_33922014.jpg\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Click the image to open in full size.\" border=\"0\" class=\"tcattdimgresizer\" src=\"http:\/\/i18.photobucket.com\/albums\/b130\/MeagT11\/052.jpg\" \/><\/span><\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"marissa.quinlan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1316801145,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245748.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mimiq","Id":245748,"Name":"mimiq","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3756c997d9eb94450909245d4e298925","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m still gathering ideas and deciding what we might do, but this is a cool idea:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"lemon+table+runner.png\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/814779\/width\/295\/height\/369\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1614203,"PostDate":1335843120,