    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> These are all so gorgeous!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Matt Adcock<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hello Ladies,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here are a handful of our personal favorite set-ups!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> It's really all about the details....We love: candles, maracas, bright colors, flowers, photos, cute place cards and signs....<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Amelia+Brooks_W_0637.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765126\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Blossom+Mark_W_0491.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765128\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Christian+Stephanie_W_0021.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765130\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Danie+Nicolas_W_0617.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765132\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Kendell+Brek_W_0319.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765136\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Amber+Stefan_W_0238.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/765138\/width\/800\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Need more ideas??? Visit our site:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/blog' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span  style=\"font-family: Helvetica;font-size: 12px\">http:\/\/www.delsolphotography.com\/blog<\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy Planning!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aquarius193@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1308166359,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241201.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"principessa","Id":241201,"Name":"principessa","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bc13f9f745f9c152e086e732b410dcb9","RawContent":"I also LOVE the tequila shot seating cards. Do you think a resort would set that up or do you think it would be too time intensive for them? I also like the idea of cocktails for seating cards too. [url=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/767808\/width\/600\/height\/469\"][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/767808\/width\/600\/height\/469[\/img][\/url]","Attachments":[],"Id":1596652,"PostDate":1332167150,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/st