rrow this idea!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1614482,"PostDate":1335886080,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> LOVE the tequila shot seating cards! I think I will borrow this idea!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shan524campbell@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1334144739,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253868.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"shanloveslexi","Id":253868,"Name":"shanloveslexi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"769c90fe15364a79d6f28d3c8d2060a7","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]shanloveslexi[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n LOVE the tequila shot seating cards! I think I will borrow this idea! \n \n \n[\/quote] \n \n Its a cool idea.   Here is one more, just a variation on a theme.  First, this entire wedding is amazing, so if you want to see more details, they are here: [url=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/post-726\/Tal-Terence-Maroma-Spa-Resort-Photos-by-Matt-Adcock\"]http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/post-726\/Tal-Terence-Maroma-Spa-Resort-Photos-by-Matt-Adcock[\/url] \n \n For this tequila cup + name...they went one step further.  Each cup was made out of wood, like a small bamboo glass. Each had a string that could hang around the necks of each person.  The B&amp;amp;G then visited each table and did a shot with the guests.  Each table had a different amazing tequila on it too...\n \n VERY FUN. \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/817641\/width\/900\/height\/600[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/817645\/width\/900\/height\/600[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/817647\/width\/900\/height\/600[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/817651\/width\/900\/height\/600[\/img] \n \n Fun?   \n \n Slideshow here: [url=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/post-726\/Tal-Terence-Maroma-Spa-Resort-Photos-by-Matt-Adcock\"]http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/post-726\/Tal-Terence-Maroma-Spa-Resort-Photos-by-Matt-Adcock[\/url]","Attachments":[],"Id":1615436,"PostDate":1336051880,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>shanloveslexi<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> LOVE the tequila shot seating cards! I think I will borrow this idea!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Its a cool idea. \u00a0 Here is one more, just a variation on a theme. \u00a0First, this entire wedding is amazing, so if you want to see more 