se,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"931e974078f6a06fc6fc5cc846f60d0e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; photos are great, good combo both relaxed &amp;nbsp;&amp;amp; elegant&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1624714,"PostDate":1338115973,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> photos are great, good combo both relaxed \u00a0& elegant<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sapnadigicam@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1338104640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255879.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"whatsup","Id":255879,"Name":"whatsup","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c32dc77a1c8a3dc3108f60270a37036b","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Matt Adcock[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n Its a cool idea.   Here is one more, just a variation on a theme.  First, this entire wedding is amazing, so if you want to see more details, they are here: [url=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/post-726\/Tal-Terence-Maroma-Spa-Resort-Photos-by-Matt-Adcock\"]http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/post-726\/Tal-Terence-Maroma-Spa-Resort-Photos-by-Matt-Adcock[\/url] \n \n For this tequila cup + name...they went one step further.  Each cup was made out of wood, like a small bamboo glass. Each had a string that could hang around the necks of each person.  The B&amp;amp;G then visited each table and did a shot with the guests.  Each table had a different amazing tequila on it too...\n \n VERY FUN. \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/817641\/width\/900\/height\/600[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/817645\/width\/900\/height\/600[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/817647\/width\/900\/height\/600[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/817651\/width\/900\/height\/600[\/img] \n \n Fun?   \n \n Slideshow here: [url=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/post-726\/Tal-Terence-Maroma-Spa-Resort-Photos-by-Matt-Adcock\"]http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/post-726\/Tal-Terence-Maroma-Spa-Resort-Photos-by-Matt-Adcock[\/url][\/quote] \n \n Love the little shot glasses with limes! I also really like the table set up - it&#039;s so simple and elegant.","Attachments":[],"Id":1624725,"PostDate":1338116931,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Matt Adcock<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> Its a cool idea. \u00a0 Here is one more, just a variation on a theme. \u00a0First, this entire wedding is amazing, so if you want to see more details, they are here:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/post-726\/Tal-Terence-Maroma-Spa-Resort-Photos-by-Matt-Adcock' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/delsolphotogr...-by-Matt-Adcock<\/a><\/p> <p> <br \/> For this tequila cup + name...they went one step further. \u00a0Each cup was made out of wood, like a small bamboo glass. Each had a string that could hang around the necks of each person. \u00a0The B&G then visited each table and did a shot with the guests. \u00a0Each table had a different amazing tequila on it too...<br \/> <br \/> VERY FUN.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"del_sol_photography_tequila_cup_details.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/817641\/width\/900\/height\/600\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"del_sol_photography_tequila_cup_detail_02.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/817645\/width\/900\/height\/600\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"del_sol_photography_tequila_cup_detail_0941.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/817647\/width\/900\/height\/600\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\" del_sol_photography_tequila_cup_detail_0944.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/817651\/width\/900\/height\/600\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Fun? \u00a0\u00a0<br \/> <br \/> Slideshow here:\u00a0<a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/post-726\/Tal-Terence-Maroma-Spa-Resort-Photos-by-Matt-Adcock' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/delsolphotogr...-by-Matt-Adcock<\/a><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Love the little shot glasses with limes! I also really like the table set up - it's so simple and elegant.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kschnella@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1328770673,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251197.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cinnagirl","Id":251197,"Name":"cinnagirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c2a88abef65a21534da0aab815e0be80","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Here are pictures of our reception tables and sweetheart table.... photos courtsey of the talented del Sol team! More here: http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=755&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"158074\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158074\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"158075\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158075\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1653607,"PostDate":1345148126,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Here are pictures of our reception tables and sweetheart table.... photos courtsey of the talented del Sol team! More here: <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=755' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/delsolphotogr...leries\/?gal=755<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"158074\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158074\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"158075\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158075\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a.diedalis@mac.com","IpAddress":"66.31.52.209","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1312057586,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243005.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrspfafftobe","Id":243005,"Name":"mrspfafftobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"70e63049bf9e2391693acca900c7ef0e","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]mrspfafftobe[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Here are pictures of our reception tables and sweetheart table.... photos courtsey of the talented del Sol team! More here: [url=\"http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=755\"]http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=755[\/url] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158074\/width\/500\/height\/1000[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158075\/width\/500\/height\/1000[\/img][\/quote] \n I LOVE this!!! Totally the look im trying to create as well... even same color scheme although mine is a bit deeper purple. Did you make the mr &amp;amp; mrs sign or buy it? Also is that burlap in the center of the table?","Attachments":[],"Id":1653639,"PostDate":1345152860,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>mrspfafftobe<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Here are pictures of our reception tables and sweetheart table.... photos courtsey of the talented del Sol team! More here: <a href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=755' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/delsolphotogr...leries\/?gal=755<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"158074\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158074\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"158075\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158075\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I LOVE this!!! Totally the look im trying to create as well... even same color scheme although mine is a bit deeper purple. Did you make the mr & mrs sign or buy it? Also is that burlap in the center of the table?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dazeydawl14@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.76.192.165","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1327958330,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250750.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Dazeydawl","Id":250750,"Name":"Dazeydawl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9f2107131fe48d861366dd623ffd4fef","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Dazeydawl,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I bought the mr and mrs sign from a seller on etsy named LazyCaterpiller. I also bought a smaller banner for our card box as well.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/transaction\/78571322&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/transaction\/78571323&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; And yes, those are burlap overlays on the table. I bought cheap burlap fabric and my mom sewed them.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1654063,"PostDate":1345230316,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Dazeydawl,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I bought the mr and mrs sign from a seller on etsy named LazyCaterpiller. I also bought a smaller banner for our card box as well.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/transaction\/78571322' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...action\/78571322<\/a><\/p> <p> <a href='https:\/\/www.etsy.com\/transaction\/78571323' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.etsy.com...action\/78571323<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> And yes, those are burlap overlays on the table. I bought cheap burlap fabric and my mom sewed them.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a.diedalis@mac.com","IpAddress":"66.31.52.209","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1312057586,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243005.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrspfafftobe","Id":243005,"Name":"mrspfafftobe","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"86b8076a6c72faf95b77980e9be67a02","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; This is Our reception table set up &amp;amp; desert table set up at Grand Velas Riviera Maya&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; (Photos By Laura Ivanova)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1345251427452_1482\"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1345251427452_2734\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"158269\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158269\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1345251427452_3537\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"158270\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158270\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1345251427452_4372\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"158271\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158271\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1345251427452_5260\"&gt; &lt;img alt=\"\" data-id=\"158272\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158272\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1654069,"PostDate":1345235137,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> This is Our reception table set up & desert table set up at Grand Velas Riviera Maya<\/p> <p> (Photos By Laura Ivanova)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1345251427452_1482\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1345251427452_2734\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"158269\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158269\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1345251427452_3537\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"158270\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158270\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1345251427452_4372\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"158271\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158271\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1345251427452_5260\"> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"\" data-id=\"158272\" data-type=\"61\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/content\/type\/61\/id\/158272\/width\/500\/height\/1000\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href=\"http:\/\/sarahandallen.com\/\">http:\/\/sarahandallen.com\/<\/a><\/p><span><\/span><p><span>Grand Velas Riviera Maya 05.19.12<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"iqtsarah@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1330361725,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252013.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":273,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sarah Wu","Id":252013,"Name":"Sarah Wu","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":45168,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a69327a2d23c7feaa7fd1ce74c707286","RawContent":"Sarah your tables looked gorgeous! Very elegant.","Attachments":[],"Id":1726368,"PostDate":1361965548,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Sarah your tables looked gorgeous! Very elegant.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pmkaraan@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1336403468,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-255054.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pmkaraan","Id":255054,"Name":"pmkaraan","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":150,"TotalPages":15,"CurrentPage":80,"NextPage":90,"PreviousPage":70,"LastPage":140},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
